{"card_hash": "8a183137b226206e827fdb9fd553a7081bf190559ca9200348ac0c6f759713b9", "channel": "Cleo Abram", "chars": 800, "chars_all_clips": 800, "chars_chosen_clips": 240, "clip_count": 1, "clips": [{"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=nlGYV0bmddI\u0026t=1s", "end": 44.52, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "e7bc33e5dd86dde53f5c1bec13c51f5d9c59584930ea877ba83b811710ddc959", "start": 1.95, "text": "In Antarctica, you're never allowed to pee on the ice, not even when you're hiking for hours. It's because it's so cold and so dry there that when it snows, it basically never melts. So, it just stacks up into layers and layers of ice and t", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "Social Media Research", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=nlGYV0bmddI\u0026t=1s", "end": 44.52, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "e7bc33e5dd86dde53f5c1bec13c51f5d9c59584930ea877ba83b811710ddc959", "start": 1.95, "text": "In Antarctica, you're never allowed to pee on the ice, not even when you're hiking for hours. It's because it's so cold and so dry there that when it snows, it basically never melts. So, it just stacks up into layers and layers of ice and t", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "hint": {"kind": "opening_prose", "text": "\u003c!-- HOOK_START --\u003e \u003c!-- HOOK_END --\u003e In Antarctica, you’re NOT ALLOWED to pee on the ice. Not even when you’re hiking for hours! It’s so cold and dry that when it snows, it basically never melts, so it stacks up into layers of ice trapping air inside…and scientists drill ice cores to study that air and learn what the environment was like thousands of years ago So if you pee…it will get trapped in the ice too. To see what’s under the ice, subscribe! #shorts #antarctica #ice #science #geology No tags [00:00:01] In Antarctica, you're never allowed to pee on the ice, not even when you're hiking f", "truncated": true}, "platform": "youtube", "profile": "librarian", "schema_version": 1, "selection_version": "spread-longest-v1", "slug": "Why_You_Can_t_Pee_On_Antarctica", "source_revision": "28369d286a6e5fdc28baa98c4a47eab68d304a5251ca9c987d0beee2dc14fe3f", "source_type": "short_video", "status": "evidenced", "summary_hint": "\u003c!-- HOOK_START --\u003e \u003c!-- HOOK_END --\u003e In Antarctica, you’re NOT ALLOWED to pee on the ice. Not even when you’re hiking for hours! It’s so cold and dry that when it snows, it basically never melts, so it stacks up into layers of ice trapping air inside…and scientists drill ice cores to study that air and learn what the environment was like thousands of years ago So if you pee…it will get trapped in the ice too. To see what’s under the ice, subscribe! #shorts #antarctica #ice #science #geology No tags [00:00:01] In Antarctica, you're never allowed to pee on the ice, not even when you're hiking f", "title": "Why You Can’t Pee On Antarctica", "topic": "Social Media Research", "truncated": true, "truncation": {"byte_budget": false, "fields": [], "selection": false}, "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nlGYV0bmddI", "video_id": "nlGYV0bmddI", "yoinked_at": "2026-07-18T00:25:32"}
